OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after video appears to show
OL,4,Aman spit on murdered MP statue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested as part of an
OL,7,Finvestigation after a TikToker uploaded
OL,8,Fa video of him appearing to spit on the
OL,9,Fstatue of a murdered MP.
OL,11,FSir David Amess was the Conservative MP
OL,12,Ffor Southend West when he was stabbed
OL,13,Fmultiple times in 2021. A statue in his
OL,14,Fmemory was unveiled in 2024.
OL,16,FEssex Police said a man in his 30s was
OL,17,Farrested in Westcliff-on-Sea on Friday
OL,18,Fafter an investigation was launched.
OL,20,FThe man was questioned on suspicion of
OL,21,Fa public order offence and criminal
OL,22,Fdamage and remains in custody.
